# macOS / iCloud Drive sync conflicts. The repository lives under ~/Documents, which iCloud
# syncs by default, and a conflict is written beside the original as "schema 2.toml" rather
# than announced. Thirty-five appeared on 4 Sep — stale copies of tracked files, all of them
# older versions whose content was already in git history.
#
# They are ignored rather than merely deleted because the failure mode is silent and expensive:
# `contracts/v1/tests` was being collected twice, so a suite reporting 801 tests was really
# running 568, and a `git add -A` would have committed the lot.
*\ [0-9].*
*\ [0-9][0-9].*
.DS_Store
